cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "hopper"
abstract: >-
  A C++23 library for building recursive-descent parsers over munch lexers: a token stream with one-token lookahead
  and source tracking, structured errors carrying the span they point at, and certified recovery after a lexical
  error under munch's complete-repair invariance. It ships two grammars on that kit, a complete RFC 8259 JSON parser
  with an explicit stack, held to the JSONTestSuite parsing cases, and a parser over the token set the
  certified-recovery campaign measured.
keywords:
  - parsing
  - recursive descent
  - JSON
  - error recovery
  - lexical analysis
  - C++
